Spec: SpecDD Task Augmentation

Purpose:
  Make Spec Kit implementation tasks authority-local where practical without splitting feature user stories across SpecDD domains.

Owns:
  ./tasks.md

References:
  ../../specdd/commands/context.sdd
  ../../specdd/commands/validate.sdd

Must:
  Task generation preserves Spec Kit user-story grouping and checklist syntax.
  Non-`.sdd` task write sets prefer one primary SpecDD authority when work is naturally decomposable.
  Legitimate cross-domain contract work remains representable when current authority permits every write.
  Spec evolution and authority evolution remain distinct from ordinary implementation work.
  Task-stage validation runs before task generation reports completion.

Done when:
  The composed task command preserves upstream grouping while exposing authority-local work and validation guidance.
